			"updated": 1772891391875,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "why pre-commit?\n1. PreCommit exists to inform participants that everyone has agreed to commit,\nso if the coordinator crashes they can safely decide what to do.\n\n2. important - timeout mechanism\n",
			"rawText": "why pre-commit?\n1. PreCommit exists to inform participants that everyone has agreed to commit,\nso if the coordinator crashes they can safely decide what to do.\n\n2. important - timeout mechanism\n",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "why pre-commit?\n1. PreCommit exists to inform participants that everyone has agreed to commit,\nso if the coordinator crashes they can safely decide what to do.\n\n2. important - timeout mechanism\n",
